                    {
                        "translation_id": "f9ca446e-1177-4108-8043-6e991253a44f",
                        "source_entry_id": "032b00b8-93f4-3be4-8a8a-b590cf426381",
                        "source_sense_id": "df7c2d30-625d-31c7-a1ad-6f0014b63b30",
                        "target_lang_word": "Baumhöhle",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Baumhöhle",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aafb565b-82eb-367d-af28-9dabf559cf75",
                                        "entry_id": "c0e2d930-881a-31d1-90bc-175af274e11c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Höhle, die sich in einem Baum befindet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ad9f410-e926-4daa-a617-edaa1da23e5d",
                                                "sense_id": "aafb565b-82eb-367d-af28-9dabf559cf75",
                                                "text": "„Das Mädchen, statt aller Antwort, faßte die Hand der Indianerin, und die beiden hoben ihre Bürde auf die soeben angezeigte Weise mit verschlungenen Händen und trugen sie der Baumhöhle zu, in welcher sie sich niederließen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93716fa5-a1b4-4c7d-9dab-9b7584c55fb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "032b00b8-93f4-3be4-8a8a-b590cf426381",
                        "source_sense_id": "df7c2d30-625d-31c7-a1ad-6f0014b63b30",
                        "target_lang_word": "дупло",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "дупло",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0f7a45f-6571-37c1-ad76-f9bfba81ca40",
                                        "entry_id": "4d6edf44-a972-3ea1-a14d-ddb19ee95d62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "пустота, отверстие в стволе дерева, образовавшееся на месте выгнившей древесины"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79901f5b-78db-4315-9d75-a362a027ab75",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f7a45f-6571-37c1-ad76-f9bfba81ca40",
                                                "text": "Разрушится сей дом, засохнет бор и сад, // Не воспомянется нигде и имя Званки; // Но сов, сычей из дупл огнезелёный взгляд // И разве дым сверкнёт с землянки."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08525911-873f-42e4-b3a9-2cca7594ee5d",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f7a45f-6571-37c1-ad76-f9bfba81ca40",
                                                "text": "Раздалася пощёчина, словно выстрел пищальный; загудел сыр-бор, посыпались листья; бросились звери со всех ног в чащу; вылетели из дупел пучеглазые совы."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e412d09f-3f84-3b1c-b408-8261d64a70b6",
                                        "entry_id": "4d6edf44-a972-3ea1-a14d-ddb19ee95d62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. отверстие, дыра в зубе"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c32bda17-9bf3-4711-a062-4814ce0ad7e6",
                        "source_entry_id": "032b00b8-93f4-3be4-8a8a-b590cf426381",
                        "source_sense_id": "df7c2d30-625d-31c7-a1ad-6f0014b63b30",
                        "target_lang_word": "albero cavo",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d7ab11d2-7922-49d8-b530-e4ad108a3f82",
                        "source_entry_id": "032b00b8-93f4-3be4-8a8a-b590cf426381",
                        "source_sense_id": "cfe88fe8-f5d7-3f3e-8b0b-f3ddfea43b71",
                        "target_lang_word": "chop shop",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chop shop",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "859c276a-1e28-3b9d-af55-b74ef4ea7136",
                                        "entry_id": "bda0e987-fa33-3ea1-b9a6-1a91fdf62ec1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A facility where stolen motor vehicles are disassembled in order to sell their mechanical parts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "012de301-c447-4c7d-b76f-85434f2e634a",
                                                "sense_id": "859c276a-1e28-3b9d-af55-b74ef4ea7136",
                                                "text": "Apparently his stolen car had been taken to a chop shop, as the police only recovered the frame."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b842ac7-058c-4aa0-a6a9-b8c3e1de5682",
                                                "sense_id": "859c276a-1e28-3b9d-af55-b74ef4ea7136",
                                                "text": "Once the car is in a chop shop, a skilled cutter can reduce it to salable parts in half an hour to 45 minutes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f713ba65-eb31-4469-8bb6-6013e2a622e1",
                                                "sense_id": "859c276a-1e28-3b9d-af55-b74ef4ea7136",
                                                "text": "New York City sports a number of chop shops, as do Chicago, Detroit and most other large metropolitan areas.[…]If they can′t find the right engine, the junkyard may call a chop shop contact to get someone on the street looking for the right make and year."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "117b4131-e73d-4f4f-af5c-6e13e7d8bc41",
                                                "sense_id": "859c276a-1e28-3b9d-af55-b74ef4ea7136",
                                                "text": "“A chop shop disassembles the entire car, so they need a location that is secluded, like a warehouse or a vacant factory — although today′s forfeiture laws tend to discourage chop shops.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "chop shop",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2bf7484-b9a0-3e66-af6d-b6518fb4227f",
                                        "entry_id": "73b40d9c-20c6-30df-994b-7691d18cb394",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of chop-shop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35c67035-b468-442b-84e7-844a2bc9e674",
                                                "sense_id": "b2bf7484-b9a0-3e66-af6d-b6518fb4227f",
                                                "text": "Seller of used car, who had fraudulently represented to buyer that the vehicle identification number (VIN) had been scratched out under windshield because former owner had been trying to prevent repossession of the car, was liable to buyer for punitive damages, based on having acted willfully or with reckless disregard for the consequences of the seller's conduct, even if the seller had not known the car had been \"chop shopped\" from two different vehicles."
                                            },
                                            {
